  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div><article id=\"dithering-with-css\"><div><p><a href=\"https://ikesau.co/tags/computers/\">computers</a></p></div><section id=\"dither-demo\"><p>handy if you're running a site with pictures but you want everything to\nmaintain a consistent aesthetic and colour scheme. might be better to just\nprocess the images and save them already dithered, but this way can be\ncustomized.</p><svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\"><filter id=\"dither\" color-interpolation-filters=\"sRGB\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"><feColorMatrix type=\"saturate\" values=\"0\" result=\"gray\"></feColorMatrix><feTurbulence type=\"fractalNoise\" baseFrequency=\".9\" numOctaves=\"1\" seed=\"2\" result=\"noise\"></feTurbulence><feComposite in=\"gray\" in2=\"noise\" operator=\"arithmetic\" k1=\"0\" k2=\".75\" k3=\".35\" k4=\"-.05\" result=\"mixed\"></feComposite><feComponentTransfer in=\"mixed\"><feFuncR type=\"discrete\" tableValues=\"0 1\"></feFuncR><feFuncG type=\"discrete\" tableValues=\"0 1\"></feFuncG><feFuncB type=\"discrete\" tableValues=\"0 1\"></feFuncB></feComponentTransfer></filter></svg><img id=\"d-image\" src=\"https://ikesau.co/images/squidward-future.png\"><h2>Noise dithering</h2><form oninput=\"updateDither()\" onsubmit=\"return!1\"><fieldset><legend>image</legend><label for=\"d-source\">source</label>\n\n<span></span></fieldset><fieldset><legend>noise</legend><label for=\"d-freq\">baseFrequency</label>\n\n<span data-for=\"d-freq\">0.90</span>\n<label for=\"d-octaves\">numOctaves</label>\n\n<span data-for=\"d-octaves\">1</span>\n<label for=\"d-seed\">seed</label>\n\n<span data-for=\"d-seed\">2</span></fieldset><fieldset><legend>mix (feComposite arithmetic)</legend><label for=\"d-k1\">k1</label>\n\n<span data-for=\"d-k1\">0.00</span>\n<label for=\"d-k2\">k2</label>\n\n<span data-for=\"d-k2\">0.75</span>\n<label for=\"d-k3\">k3</label>\n\n<span data-for=\"d-k3\">0.35</span>\n<label for=\"d-k4\">k4</label>\n\n<span data-for=\"d-k4\">-0.05</span></fieldset><fieldset><legend>two-tone</legend><label for=\"d-tone\">enabled</label><p>\n<label for=\"d-dark\">dark</label>\n\n<label for=\"d-light\">light</label>\n</p><span></span></fieldset></form></section><section id=\"bayer-demo\"><svg width=\"0\" height=\"0\"><filter id=\"bayer-dither\" color-interpolation-filters=\"sRGB\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\"><feColorMatrix in=\"SourceGraphic\" type=\"saturate\" values=\"0\" result=\"gray\"></feColorMatrix><feImage href=\"/images/bayer16tile2.png\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" result=\"bayerTile\"></feImage><feTile in=\"bayerTile\" result=\"bayerPattern\"></feTile><feComposite in=\"gray\" in2=\"bayerPattern\" operator=\"arithmetic\" k1=\"0\" k2=\"1\" k3=\"-1\" k4=\".5\" result=\"mixed\"></feComposite><feComponentTransfer in=\"mixed\"><feFuncR type=\"discrete\" tableValues=\"0 1\"></feFuncR><feFuncG type=\"discrete\" tableValues=\"0 1\"></feFuncG><feFuncB type=\"discrete\" tableValues=\"0 1\"></feFuncB></feComponentTransfer></filter></svg></section></article></div></div>",
